Z||000001||stimpy||05-27-2001||09:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero4never:<BR><B> Its no joke<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes it is. Don't believe everything you read in the funny pages. Where is the picture? Where's the pricing details? Wouldn't intercooling a SC3.8 require completely relocating the supercharger? And why doesn't ACE work on developing a torque strut first so you don't have the tell-tale alternator gash in your decklid that just screams "ACE quality"! If there was an intercooler option for the sc3.8, Chris West woulda told us. <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A>  ||||reg||1
