Z||000004||Phil||05-27-2001||12:18 PM||||Thrasher Racing makes an intercooler for the SC3800. It's an water to air type  and it fits in between the blower and the intake mainfold raising the blower 2.6" supposed to add about 40-50 hp. The guy with a Ferrari rebody(same one at Louisville) has it on his car and got on the dyno on Power Tour - pulled about 245 at the wheels ( mine w/o intercooler did 222). 350 at the crank might be a touch optimistic-300to310 might be closer.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_1.gif">  <BR>SC 3800||||reg||1
